OL,3,AThree Egyptian security officials
OL,4,Aconvicted of kidnapping Italian student
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree Egyptian security officials have
OL,7,Fbeen convicted by a Rome court over the
OL,8,Fkidnapping of an Italian student whose
OL,9,Ftortured body was found in Cairo a
OL,10,Fdecade ago.
OL,12,FThe men, who were tried in absentia,
OL,13,Fdenied the charges. On Monday they were
OL,14,Fsentenced to 10 years in prison on
OL,15,Fcharges of aggravated kidnapping. A
OL,16,Ffourth Egyptian defendant was
OL,17,Facquitted.
OL,19,FGiulio Regeni, 28, was studying for a
OL,20,Fdoctorate at Cambridge University when
OL,21,Fhe went missing while on a research
OL,22,Ftrip in Egypt in 2016.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
